  "title": "Thriving Amid Constraints: Strategies for Assessment Offices",
  "summary": "Walk into almost any assessment office right now and you’ll hear some version of the same story: fewer staff, more parcels, sharper questions from the public. None of those pressures are new on their own. Feeling all three at once is what is wearing assessment offices down. One of the biggest benefits of my role at Tyler Technologies is the exposure to what’s happening across the assessment industry. I spend most of my time talking with assessors, appraisers, and tax auditors working...",
